        "created_at": "2014-12-17T22:33:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I saw this (posted by Jodi on G+, entertainingly enough  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=9\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\"> ) and immediately thought of The Matriarch. Written by Chris Hallbeck, sung to tune of <em>Let It Snow</em>:</p>\n<p>Well the weather outside is frightful<br>But inside is equally frightful<br>No matter which room you go<br>Full of crows<br>Full of crows<br>Full of crows</p>\n<p>Anyone else find/think of a good Sentinels-related joke / spoof, even unintentional like this?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:04.885Z",
